WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.046
Zippy drove very fast.

2
00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:18.423
But he didn’t hit the cones.

3
00:00:18.424 --> 00:00:28.036
And he stopped at the sign.

4
00:00:28.037 --> 00:00:32.300
"Good job, Zippy," said Ms. Fender.

5
00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:35.433
"But next time go slow."

6
00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:38.368
"Sorry," said Zippy.

7
00:00:38.369 --> 00:00:41.294
"I'm just too fast!"

8
00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:43.591
Eddy frowned.

9
00:00:43.592 --> 00:00:45.851
Poppy went next.

10
00:00:45.852 --> 00:00:53.666
Honk! Honk!

11
00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:56.993
Poppy knocked over a cone.

12
00:00:56.994 --> 00:01:02.127
"Whee!" she cried.

13
00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:06.458
"Stop being silly, Poppy!" said Ms. Fender.

14
00:01:06.459 --> 00:01:10.915
"Sorry!" said Poppy.

15
00:01:10.916 --> 00:01:15.468
"La, la, la, la!" Poppy sang.

16
00:01:15.469 --> 00:01:19.712
She drove past the stop sign.

17
00:01:19.713 --> 00:01:23.837
"You didn't stop!" cried Ms. Fender.

18
00:01:23.838 --> 00:01:28.170
"Sorry!" said Poppy.

19
00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:32.340
Then it was Eddy's turn.

20
00:01:32.341 --> 00:01:36.126
"Remember, Eddy," said Ms. Fender.

21
00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:39.422
"Don’t go too fast."

22
00:01:39.423 --> 00:01:41.887
Zippy laughed.

23
00:01:41.888 --> 00:01:44.213
"Don’t worry, Ms. Fender.

24
00:01:44.214 --> 00:01:48.584
Eddy won’t go too fast!"

25
00:01:48.585 --> 00:01:53.583
Eddy's engine roared.

